OL,2,V55555555CTHATCHER MUST GO,
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSAYS DROPPED MEYER
OL,5, Sir Anthony Meyer, dropped as a
OL,6, Conservative candidate for the next
OL,7, election, has renewed his call for Mrs
OL,8, Thatcher to be replaced as Tory leader.
OL,10, "The Conservatives have no God-given
OL,11, right to govern the country and I still
OL,12, want a new leader of our Party,"he said
OL,14, Speaking at Rhyl, N Wales, after his
OL,15, deselection from his Clwyd North West
OL,16, constituency, he said his message to
OL,17, Mrs Thatcher was to start listening.
OL,19, Sir Anthony, 69, dropped following his
OL,20, challenge to her for the leadership,
OL,21, said the decision was "disastrous".
