OL,2,V55555555CLABOUR SWEEP TO
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C11-POINT LEAD - POLL
OL,5, Labour have swept into a commanding 11-
OL,6, point lead over the Conservatives,
OL,7, according to a survey in the Observer.
OL,9, But the Harris Poll contrasts sharply
OL,10, with a Labour lead of only four points
OL,11, shown by a NOP survey conducted for The
OL,12, Independent and BBC2's Newsnight.
OL,14, The latest poll shows Labour gaining
OL,15, two points and the Tories losing two.
OL,17, Figures (with last month's results in
OL,18, brackets) are: Labour 48 (46), Tories
OL,19, 37 (39), Liberal Democrats 6 (6),
OL,20, Greens 4 (5), SDP 3 (1) and
OL,21, Nationalists 2 (3).
