OL,2,V55555555CYUGOSLAV COMMUNISTS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CATTACK OPPOSITION
OL,5, Yugoslavia's ruling Communist Party has
OL,6, attacked the growing opposition to its
OL,7, 45-year-old monopoly on power during an
OL,8, emergency congress.
OL,10, Party leader Milan Pancevski dismissed
OL,11, calls for a multi-party parliamentary
OL,12, democracy as "unacceptable".
OL,14, However, a draft document gives the
OL,15, Party's assent to free elections but
OL,16, stops short of a multi-party system.
OL,18,SGPope John Paul will make the first
OL,19, visit by a pontiff to Czechoslovakia
OL,20, before the June elections, the Vatican
OL,21, has said.
