OL,2,V55555555CAZERBAIJAN UNDER
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCONTROL - GORBACHEV
OL,5, President Gorbachev has said troops are
OL,6, now in control of the Soviet republic
OL,7, of Azerbaijan after being ordered in to
OL,8, quell a nationalist uprising.
OL,10, Rebel sources say at least 120 people
OL,11, died when Soviet tanks rolled into the
OL,12, capital Baku but other estimates put
OL,13, the total as high as 3,500.
OL,15, In a television address, Mr Gorbachev
OL,16, said the USSR had tried for two years
OL,17, to achieve a peaceful solution but had
OL,18, to use military force in the uprising.
OL,20,SGAzerbaijan's Communist Party chief
OL,21, Abdul-Rahman Vezirov has been sacked.
