OL,2,V55555555CNAKHICHEVAN DECLARES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CINDEPENDENCE FROM USSR
OL,5, The TV station in the Moslem city of
OL,6, Nakhichevan in Soviet Azerbaijan has
OL,7, broadcast a unilateral declaration of
OL,8, independence, says Iran's news agency.
OL,10, The IRNA agency also reported that
OL,11, thousands of Soviet Moslems crossed
OL,12, into Iran and staged a demonstration
OL,13, supporting the Ayatollah Al Khamenei.
OL,15, The resolution called for withdrawal of
OL,16, Soviet troops from the city near the
OL,17, borders with Iran and Turkey.
OL,19, And it appealed to world governments
OL,20, and the UN to safeguard Nakhichevan's
OL,21, territorial rights.
