OL,2,V55555555C HOSTAGES USED AS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C'INSURANCE POLICY'
OL,5, A former British ambassador to Iran has
OL,6, said he believes Terry Waite and the
OL,7, other four hostages are still alive.
OL,9, Speaking on the third anniversary of
OL,10, the kidnap of Mr Waite, Sir Anthony
OL,11, Parsons said he thought they were being
OL,12, used as an "insurance policy".
OL,14, This would tie in with the "very
OL,15, puzzling" fact that the hostage-takers
OL,16, have never made any demands for them.
OL,18, Meanwhile, friends turned out for an
OL,19, all-day vigil for Mr Waite at his local
OL,20, church in Blackheath, London.
