OL,2,V55555555CUSA DROPS OPPOSITION
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5COVER BOAT PEOPLE
OL,5, The USA has withdrawn its opposition to
OL,6, Britain's decision to forcibly return
OL,7, boat people from Hong Kong to Vietnam,
OL,8, officials have announced.
OL,10, But in exchange Washington is demanding
OL,11, a one-year delay, while relief workers
OL,12, try to persuade the boat people it is
OL,13, safe for them to go back.
OL,15, The revised US position will be
OL,16, presented at an 18-nation meeting in
OL,17, Geneva next week where a solution will
OL,18, be sought to the problem of boat people
OL,19, Britain has indicated it will reject a
OL,20, year-long moratorium, but a compromise
OL,21, - possibly of six months - is expected.
