OL,2,V55555555CAIR-SEA SEARCH AFTER
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMAYDAY CALL
OL,5, An air-and-sea search is underway in
OL,6, the Atlantic after a distress call from
OL,7, a ship.
OL,9, The Mayday message, believed to be from
OL,10, the Spanish-registered Armin Rose, said
OL,11, the ship was taking in water 220 miles
OL,12, south west of Land's End.
OL,14, Ten people are reported to have taken
OL,15, to liferafts and coastguards at
OL,16, Falmouth, Cornwall, are coordinating
OL,17, an international rescue operation.
OL,19, An RAF Nimrod aircraft is hoping to
OL,20, locate the liferafts by radar and
OL,21, several ships are heading for the area.
